  "jobId": "test_keith_murray_doc_2min",
  "designedFromScratch": true,
  "description": "Title card: camera glides over a 3D dictionary page (three.js) with the subject's entry highlighted and his photo print on the page; name types on letter by letter (GSAP SplitText), then pronunciation, place and year land on narration words.",
  "note": "This manifest describes which parts of THIS custom scene are safe to change. It is not a template and is never reused to generate other scenes."
 },
